
flowchart TD
    U[User submits Job Description]
    A[LangGraph Matching Agent]
    C[MCP Client]
    S[Filesystem MCP Server]
    R[MCP Resources]
    T[MCP Tools]
    F[Resume Filesystem]
    P[Resume Parser]
    B[Batch Processing]
    G[LangGraph Matching Workflow]
    M[Keyword Scoring and Ranking]
    O[Ranked Candidate Results]
    W[Directory Watcher]

    U --> A
    A --> C
    C <-->|JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio| S

    S --> R
    S --> T

    R --> R1[resumes://list]
    R --> R2[resume://filename]

    T --> T1[list_files]
    T --> T2[read_file]
    T --> T3[batch_process]
    T --> T4[watch_directory]
    T --> T5[get_server_config]

    T1 --> F
    T2 --> F
    T3 --> B
    B --> F
    F --> P
    P --> G

    W --> T4

    G --> M
    M --> O
